*> Held-item poses fed by the replica: the enderman's carried block (entry 16, OPTIONAL_BLOCK_STATE, raw VarInt, 0 none) and creepy flag (entry 17, BOOLEAN) pose EF6-ENDERMAN-ANIM; the iron golem's attack
*> tick (Entity Event 4: 10) and offer-flower tick (event 11: 400, event 34: 0), both falling by 1 a tick, pose EM3-IRON-GOLEM-ANIM (attackTicksRemaining, offerFlowerTick).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-ENTITY-GOLEM-ENDERMAN.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 COPY CLCONST.
 COPY CONTENT.
 COPY CLMODELS.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ROW-AREA            PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-TYPE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X                   FLOAT-LONG VALUE 10.5.
 01 WS-Y                   FLOAT-LONG VALUE 64.
 01 WS-Z                   FLOAT-LONG VALUE 10.5.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 01 WS-ID                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-J                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ROW                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-INDEX               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SER                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-V1                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-V2                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-V3                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LONG                BINARY-DOUBLE VALUE 0.
 01 WS-EV                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DIFF                FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-SUM1                FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-SUM2                FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-EYE-TABLE.
    05 WS-EYE              FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 3 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "CL-INIT" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO PK-COUNT
     CALL "ENTITY-ATLAS-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 256 TO PL-HEIGHT
     MOVE 0 TO SK-U
     MOVE 10 TO WS-EYE(1) WS-EYE(3)
     MOVE 64 TO WS-EYE(2)
     MOVE 1 TO CT-OPEN
     MOVE CT-TYPE-STANDARD TO CT-SET-TYPE
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE "enderman" TO WS-KEY
     PERFORM SPAWN-ONE
     MOVE 1 TO WS-ROW
     MOVE 0 TO WS-V2 WS-V3
     MOVE 16 TO WS-INDEX
     MOVE 15 TO WS-SER
     MOVE 42 TO WS-V1
     CALL "ENTITY-VARIANT-SET" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-INDEX WS-SER WS-V1 WS-V2 WS-V3 WS-LONG
     MOVE "acceptance enderman carried block" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE EN-CARRY(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     MOVE 42 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM CHECK-N
     MOVE 17 TO WS-INDEX
     MOVE 8 TO WS-SER
     MOVE 1 TO WS-V1
     CALL "ENTITY-VARIANT-SET" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-INDEX WS-SER WS-V1 WS-V2 WS-V3 WS-LONG
     MOVE "acceptance enderman creepy" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE EN-CREEPY(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM CHECK-N
*>   Posed: no carry or creepy, carried, creepy.
     MOVE 0 TO EN-CARRY(1) EN-CREEPY(1)
     CALL "ENTITIES-MESH" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-EYE-TABLE
     PERFORM SUM-MESH
     MOVE WS-SUM2 TO WS-SUM1
     MOVE 42 TO EN-CARRY(1)
     CALL "ENTITIES-MESH" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-EYE-TABLE
     PERFORM SUM-MESH
     MOVE "acceptance enderman drawn carrying a block" TO TL-CASE
     COMPUTE WS-DIFF = WS-SUM2 - WS-SUM1
     PERFORM CHECK-OTHER
     MOVE WS-SUM2 TO WS-SUM1
     MOVE 1 TO EN-CREEPY(1)
     CALL "ENTITIES-MESH" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-EYE-TABLE
     PERFORM SUM-MESH
     MOVE "acceptance enderman drawn creepy" TO TL-CASE
     COMPUTE WS-DIFF = WS-SUM2 - WS-SUM1
     PERFORM CHECK-OTHER
*>   A cow ignores the entries.
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE "cow" TO WS-KEY
     PERFORM SPAWN-ONE
     MOVE 16 TO WS-INDEX
     MOVE 15 TO WS-SER
     MOVE 42 TO WS-V1
     CALL "ENTITY-VARIANT-SET" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-INDEX WS-SER WS-V1 WS-V2 WS-V3 WS-LONG
     MOVE 17 TO WS-INDEX
     MOVE 8 TO WS-SER
     CALL "ENTITY-VARIANT-SET" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-INDEX WS-SER WS-V1 WS-V2 WS-V3 WS-LONG
     MOVE "acceptance cow carries nothing" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE EN-CARRY(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM CHECK-N
     MOVE "acceptance cow is not creepy" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE EN-CREEPY(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM CHECK-N
*>   The iron golem: event 4 attack 10, event 11 flower 400, event 34 flower 0; both fall by 1 a tick.
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE "iron_golem" TO WS-KEY
     PERFORM SPAWN-ONE
     MOVE 4 TO WS-EV
     CALL "ENTITY-EVENT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-EV
     MOVE "acceptance iron golem attack tick" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE EN-ATK(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     MOVE 10 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM CHECK-N
     MOVE 11 TO WS-EV
     CALL "ENTITY-EVENT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-EV
     MOVE "acceptance iron golem offers a flower" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE EN-FLW(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     MOVE 400 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM CHECK-N
     CALL "ENTITIES-ANIM-TICK" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE "acceptance iron golem attack tick falls" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE EN-ATK(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     MOVE 9 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM CHECK-N
     MOVE "acceptance iron golem flower tick falls" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE EN-FLW(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     MOVE 399 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM CHECK-N
     MOVE 5 TO EN-ATK(1)
     CALL "ENTITIES-MESH" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-EYE-TABLE
     PERFORM SUM-MESH
     MOVE WS-SUM2 TO WS-SUM1
     MOVE 0 TO EN-ATK(1)
     CALL "ENTITIES-MESH" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-EYE-TABLE
     PERFORM SUM-MESH
     MOVE "acceptance iron golem drawn attacking" TO TL-CASE
     COMPUTE WS-DIFF = WS-SUM2 - WS-SUM1
     PERFORM CHECK-OTHER
     MOVE WS-SUM2 TO WS-SUM1
     MOVE 0 TO EN-FLW(1)
     CALL "ENTITIES-MESH" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-EYE-TABLE
     PERFORM SUM-MESH
     MOVE "acceptance iron golem drawn offering a flower" TO TL-CASE
     COMPUTE WS-DIFF = WS-SUM2 - WS-SUM1
     PERFORM CHECK-OTHER
     MOVE 34 TO WS-EV
     MOVE 300 TO EN-FLW(1)
     CALL "ENTITY-EVENT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-EV
     MOVE "acceptance iron golem stops offering the flower" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE EN-FLW(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM CHECK-N
*>   Idle ticks keep the counters at 0.
     CALL "ENTITIES-ANIM-TICK" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE "acceptance iron golem counters stay at 0" TO TL-CASE
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = EN-ATK(1) + EN-FLW(1)
     PERFORM CHECK-N
*>   Another mob ignores events 4, 11 and 34.
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE "cow" TO WS-KEY
     PERFORM SPAWN-ONE
     MOVE 4 TO WS-EV
     CALL "ENTITY-EVENT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-EV
     MOVE 11 TO WS-EV
     CALL "ENTITY-EVENT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-EV
     MOVE "acceptance cow has no attack or flower" TO TL-CASE
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = EN-ATK(1) + EN-FLW(1)
     PERFORM CHECK-N
     STOP RUN.
 SPAWN-ONE.
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-TYPE WS-ROW-AREA WS-STATUS
     MOVE 1 TO WS-ID
     CALL "MM-SPAWN" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW.
 SUM-MESH.
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SUM2
     PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-J > RL-EN-COUNT
         COMPUTE WS-SUM2 = WS-SUM2 + (RL-EN-Y(WS-J) + RL-EN-X(WS-J) * 2 + RL-EN-Z(WS-J) * 3) * WS-J
     END-PERFORM.
 CHECK-OTHER.
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE 0 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     IF WS-DIFF > 0.001 OR WS-DIFF < -0.001
         MOVE 1 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     END-IF
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 CHECK-N.
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM TEST-ENTITY-GOLEM-ENDERMAN.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. MM-SPAWN.
*> USING CLIENT-STATE, entity id, type (registry id), x y z (FLOAT-LONG), yaw (FLOAT-SHORT, also the head yaw): Add Entity.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 WS-READY               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 1024.
 01 WS-ADD                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-ZERO                BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-UUID                PIC X(16) VALUE LOW-VALUES.
 01 WS-V0                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-V1                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-V2                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-A0                  FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-ID                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-TYPE                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-X                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-Y                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-Z                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-YAW                  FLOAT-SHORT.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLIENT-STATE L-ID L-TYPE L-X L-Y L-Z L-YAW.
     IF WS-READY = 0
         CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
         MOVE 1 TO WS-READY
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER L-ID
     CALL "PB-PUT-UUID" USING PB-BUFFER WS-UUID
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER L-TYPE
     CALL "PB-PUT-DOUBLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-X
     CALL "PB-PUT-DOUBLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-Y
     CALL "PB-PUT-DOUBLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-Z
     CALL "PB-PUT-LPVEC3" USING PB-BUFFER WS-V0 WS-V1 WS-V2
     CALL "PB-PUT-ANGLE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-A0
     CALL "PB-PUT-ANGLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-YAW
     CALL "PB-PUT-ANGLE" USING PB-BUFFER L-YAW
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-ZERO
     MOVE 0 TO PB-POS
     CALL "ENTITY-PACKET" USING CLIENT-STATE PB-BUFFER WS-ADD
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM MM-SPAWN.


